<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices - July 28.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices - July 28.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST  180 CST    MDO    GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	   96/98     98/100    UNQ    168/170</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	  98/100   100/103  160/165  175/178</p>
<p>--------</p>
<p>COMMENTS - The Singapore bunker market was little changed on Monday amid few enquiries and a lack of movement in the cargo market, traders said. Bunker 380-cst supplies were heard done at below the $100-per-tonne level, said one trader.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (65-870-3571)</p>
</text>
